[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the method of finding the maximum value of a linear combination of sine and cosine functions. The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\).
