[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m 1. **Express \(z\) in terms of its real and imaginary parts:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m 2. **Substitute \(z\) into the expression:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = (24 - 36i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta - 24i\sin\theta + 36i\cos\theta = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + i(4(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta) + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14257)[0m    \]
